			"id": "AIsf4k-p9LwEYhLXZ",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 13, DX 12, IQ 6, HT 12, HP 17, WILL 10, PER 12, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 10, DODGE 9, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
