			"id": "AoQtsqbFfKE-HUg2y",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 35 (offense 21, protection 14), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "AG9Ho35LYrPfBnvW3",
			"text": "Bay: When a creature (except evil outsiders) hears the howl of a yeth hound, it must roll an immediate Fright Check. If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this ability for one hour."
		},
